                "sourceId": "dnd2024.source.srd-5.2.1",
                "locator": "Rules Glossary > Weapon Attack (SRD 5.2.1, pages 191-191)"
              },
              {
                "sourceId": "dnd2024.source.srd-5.2.1",
                "locator": "Playing the Game > Actions > Attack (SRD 5.2.1, pages 9-9)"
              }
            ],
